                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "text_3CNWxQ": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "enable_custom_font": false,
                    "custom_class": "c",
                    "text": "<p>Every tale needs a form. Every story begins with a face, a stance, and a weapon drawn. At RPG Guild, we shape those first sparks of imagination into real, playable miniatures. Our team of artists, dreamers, and makers crafts pieces for those who value story over stats and presence over plastic.</p><p>We don’t just offer characters—we offer identity. Heroes, monsters, allies, villains. They’re printed in high-resolution, hand-detailed, and made to stand through battle after battle. You’ll feel the quality the moment they touch the table.</p><p>The result? More immersion = better storytelling = unforgettable sessions.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "center",
                    "type_preset": "custom",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "balance",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
