                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "text_Xfh4kB": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "enable_custom_font": false,
                    "custom_class": "hidden-text-1",
                    "text": "<h2>From Dream to Tabletop</h2><p>We know how it feels to build a world from scratch. Every sculpt we carry comes from creators who believe in narrative-first design. Artisan Guild, Cast’ n’ Play, and others join forces with us to bring depth, motion, and emotion into every figure.</p><p>And we do more than distribute—we shape each one ourselves. Each <strong>DnD miniature</strong> is printed in-house using 12K resin printers, then UV-cured and cleaned for durability. We keep the sizing consistent, the details crisp, and the scaling accurate to 5e.</p><p>This is art you can play with—and it’s ready when your story is.</p><h2>Made to Travel Through Realms</h2><p>Your world isn’t static. Neither are our minis. From pocket dungeons to vast battlefields, our figures are built to survive the journey. Flexible resin means less breakage, and our hands-on production means fewer flaws.</p><p>Here’s what you can expect:</p><ul><li>4500+ unique sculpts</li><li>Smooth, paint-ready surfaces</li><li>Size customizations on request</li></ul><p>We don’t overpromise—we simply deliver figures that last. No guesswork, no cleanup chaos. That’s why so many returns to us for their personal stash of <strong>DnD figures</strong>.</p><p>Reliable = ready for adventure.</p><h2>A Collection Worth the Quest</h2><p>Every GM has a different vision. Every player has a different path. Our catalog spans from ancient beasts to elven rogues to spectral undead. No matter your campaign, something here fits like it was made just for it.</p><p>Need an encounter built fast? Our search filters make that simple. Want a specific character type? Filter by class, race, or monster group. Want to be surprised? Try a Mystery Box and let the dice decide.</p><p>We shape our selection from starter bundles to epic one-offs with your world in mind. When you’re ready to expand your roster of <strong>DnD models</strong>, we’ll be here.</p><h2>Adventurers at Heart, Just Like You</h2><p>We didn’t start with a storefront. We started around a table—laughing, plotting, failing rolls, and winning moments. RPG Guild was born from players who wanted better options: minis that didn’t break didn’t blur, and didn’t cost a fortune.</p><p>Today, we’re proud to serve a global community. Over 7,000 five-star reviews. Orders shipped worldwide. Friendly support with real responses, not automated walls.</p><p>Need help? We listen. Want to send in an STL? We’ll handle it. If you order above $60, shipping is on us.</p><p>This isn’t just a <strong>DnD store</strong>. It’s a gathering place. A tavern at the crossroads of creation.</p><h2>Crafted by Hands That Play</h2><p>We’re not just makers - we’re players too. Every piece we offer is tested in real campaigns, on real tables, by real GMs and party members. We know the frustration of fragile minis, sloppy prints, or characters that don’t quite fit the setting. That’s the reason we developed our process from the ground up to address it.</p><p>Our miniatures are made in small batches with quality control at every step. Resin is mixed, poured, printed, cleaned, and cured—by us. That means more consistency, better durability, and no surprise flaws. We tweak the scale. We review every order. And if you need help? You’re speaking with someone who’s painted a mimic or two themselves.</p><p>When a figure from RPG Guild lands on your map, it fits right in. It was designed by someone who’s sat where you sit—rolling the dice, narrating the next twist, imagining what’s around the corner.</p><h2>What Will You Bring to Life?</h2><p>Every session is a chance to tell a story. Every miniature is a character waiting to be named, painted, and played. We keep expanding, refining, and listening—to give you sculpts that feel like they belong in your world.</p><p>From our humble beginnings to thousands of orders later, we’ve stayed focused on the same goal: bringing personality, quality, and soul to the table. And for many, we’ve become the place they return to when they need <strong>DnD miniatures</strong> that feel alive.</p><p>So what will it be? A lone ranger? A dragon queen? A cursed knight waiting for redemption? Whoever they are, they belong here. And they’re ready for your campaign.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "center",
